---
---

<section class="text-[var(--white)] py-12 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-12">
    <div class="space-y-4 text-center md:text-left">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium">Core Competencies</h2>
      <p class="text-[var(--white-icon)] text-lg">
        What I build and how I approach software engineering
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#ffffff10] bg-[#1414149c] p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[var(--sec)] hover:bg-[#1a1a2e]">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--sec)]/10 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" />
        <div class="relative space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] group-hover:text-[var(--sec)] transition-colors">System Architecture & Design</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--white-icon)] text-sm">
            <li>• Database design and optimization</li>
            <li>• API architecture and design patterns</li>
            <li>• Scalability planning and implementation</li>
            <li>• Performance profiling and optimization</li>
            <li>• System reliability and fault tolerance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#ffffff10] bg-[#1414149c] p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[var(--sec)] hover:bg-[#1a1a2e]">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--sec)]/10 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" />
        <div class="relative space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] group-hover:text-[var(--sec)] transition-colors">Backend Development</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--white-icon)] text-sm">
            <li>• RESTful and API design</li>
            <li>• Data pipeline engineering</li>
            <li>• Microservices architecture</li>
            <li>• Query optimization and indexing</li>
            <li>• Caching strategies and implementation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#ffffff10] bg-[#1414149c] p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[var(--sec)] hover:bg-[#1a1a2e]">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--sec)]/10 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" />
        <div class="relative space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] group-hover:text-[var(--sec)] transition-colors">Infrastructure & DevOps</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--white-icon)] text-sm">
            <li>• Docker containerization</li>
            <li>• CI/CD pipeline design</li>
            <li>• AWS cloud infrastructure</li>
            <li>• Automated testing and deployment</li>
            <li>• System monitoring and observability</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#ffffff10] bg-[#1414149c] p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[var(--sec)] hover:bg-[#1a1a2e]">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--sec)]/10 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" />
        <div class="relative space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] group-hover:text-[var(--sec)] transition-colors">Code Quality & Testing</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--white-icon)] text-sm">
            <li>• Unit and integration testing</li>
            <li>• Test-driven development</li>
            <li>• Code review and standards</li>
            <li>• Performance auditing</li>
            <li>• WCAG accessibility compliance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#ffffff10] bg-[#1414149c] p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[var(--sec)] hover:bg-[#1a1a2e]">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--sec)]/10 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" />
        <div class="relative space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] group-hover:text-[var(--sec)] transition-colors">Full-Stack Development</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--white-icon)] text-sm">
            <li>• End-to-end application architecture</li>
            <li>• Frontend & backend integration</li>
            <li>• Cross-platform compatibility</li>
            <li>• Developer experience optimization</li>
            <li>• Production deployment and support</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[#ffffff10] bg-[#1414149c] p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-[var(--sec)] hover:bg-[#1a1a2e]">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[var(--sec)]/10 to-transparent opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100" />
        <div class="relative space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--white)] group-hover:text-[var(--sec)] transition-colors">Industries & Domains</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-[var(--white-icon)] text-sm">
            <li>• Enterprise platforms and integration</li>
            <li>• Healthcare technology</li>
            <li>• Claims processing systems</li>
            <li>• Educational technology</li>
            <li>• Independent ownership and leadership</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
